    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Over 200 healthcare professionals, students, and educators gathered at the Aga Khan University for the 2nd International Allied Health Conference, a vibrant celebration of innovation, learning, and collaboration in healthcare. Held under the theme \"Three Shifts: Hospital to Community, Treatment to Prevention, Analogue to Digital,\" the two-day event explored how allied health professionals are redefining the delivery of care in a rapidly changing world.",
